  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduction to Nmap</title>

    <para>
      <application>Nmap</application> is a utility for network exploration and
security auditing. It supports ping scanning, port scanning and TCP/IP
fingerprinting.
    </para>

    &lfs124_checked;

